        "responseBody": "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Favfare Patient Assistant</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif;background:#e7eee9;color:#17241e;min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:22px}.wrap{width:min(1020px,100%);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 390px;gap:34px;align-items:center}.intro small{font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#426454}.intro h1{font-size:44px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:10px 0}.intro p{color:#65716b;line-height:1.7;max-width:540px}.note{background:white;padding:18px;border-radius:18px;margin-top:24px;border:1px solid #d9e3dc}.phone{height:760px;max-height:90vh;background:#efeae2;border-radius:26px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 70px rgba(16,50,36,.22);display:flex;flex-direction:column}.top{background:#075e54;color:white;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}.avatar{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;background:white;color:#075e54;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:900}.top strong{display:block}.top span{font-size:12px;opacity:.8}.status{font-size:11px;padding:7px 12px;background:#fff7cf;text-align:center;color:#715800}.chat{flex:1;overflow:auto;padding:18px 14px;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.025) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:18px 18px}.msg{display:flex;margin:9px 0}.bubble{max-width:82%;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:9px;line-height:1.45;font-size:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,.08);background:white;border-top-left-radius:2px}.controls{padding:10px;background:#f0f2f5}.composer{display:flex;gap:8px}.composer input{flex:1;border:0;border-radius:22px;padding:12px 15px;font-size:14px;outline:none}.composer button{width:44px;height:44px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:#00a884;color:white;font-size:18px;cursor:pointer}.quick{margin-top:8px}.quick button{width:100%;border:1px solid #a9c7b8;background:white;color:#12624c;padding:10px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}.crm{display:inline-block;margin-top:16px;color:#2e5b49;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}@media(max-width:850px){.wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}.intro h1{font-size:34px}.phone{height:72vh}}</style></head><body><div class=\"wrap\"><section class=\"intro\"><small>BIZI SYSTEMS · LIVE SALES DEMO</small><h1>Favfare Patient Assistant</h1><p>This patient-facing simulator is connected to the real Favfare demo automation and enquiry CRM. Prices come from structured clinic data and appointment requests remain pending until staff confirms them.</p><div class=\"note\"><strong>Suggested flow</strong><br>Ask the Scaling & Polishing price → request an appointment → choose a live slot → open the staff CRM.</div><a class=\"crm\" href=\"/webhook/favfare-demo/crm-ui\" target=\"_blank\">Open staff CRM ↗</a></section><section class=\"phone\"><div class=\"top\"><div class=\"avatar\">F</div><div><strong>Favfare The Clinic</strong><span>Patient Assistant · online</span></div></div><div class=\"status\">Demo · appointment requests require staff confirmation</div><div class=\"chat\"><div class=\"msg\"><div class=\"bubble\">Hello 👋 Welcome to Favfare The Clinic. How may I help you today?</div></div></div><div class=\"controls\"><form class=\"composer\" method=\"post\" action=\"/webhook/favfare-demo/patient-action\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"action\" value=\"quote\"><input name=\"message\" placeholder=\"Type a message\" value=\"\"><button>➤</button></form><form class=\"quick\" method=\"post\" action=\"/webhook/favfare-demo/patient-action\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"action\" value=\"quote\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"message\" value=\"How much is scaling and polishing?\"><button>Scaling & Polishing price</button></form></div></section></div></body></html>",
